       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PROGWEB.
      *> AUTHOR. OTTONI, RONALDO.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

      *>   DEFAULT VARIABLES TO BE USED ALL PROGRAMS 
       COPY "copy\PGMWORK.WS".
       
       01  WS-PROGWEB-WORK-VARS.
           05  FILLER              PIC  X(001)     VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-MENSAGEM         PIC  X(200)     VALUE SPACES.
       
       01  WK-PARAMETERS-WEB.
           05  WK-PROGRAM          PIC  X(010)     VALUE SPACES.
           05  WK-PARAMETERS       PIC  X(200)     VALUE SPACES.
           05  WK-DATA             PIC  X(10000)   VALUE SPACES.

      *>   VARIABLES TO PREPAR THE LINKAGE'S CALL
       COPY "copy\PGMLINK.WS".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCESS.
           ACCEPT WK-PARAMETERS-WEB FROM ENVIRONMENT "PARAMETERS"

           MOVE WK-PARAMETERS(1:200)   TO LK-PARAMETERS
           CALL WK-PROGRAM USING LK-PARAMETERS
           CANCEL WK-PROGRAM

           STOP RUN
           .

       END PROGRAM PROGWEB.
